orm:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:var(--color-text-muted);margin:0\">A realm is forming</h3><p style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading);font-size:17px;font-weight:700;color:var(--color-text);margin:0\">Raid (1 hour)</p><p style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--color-text-muted);margin:0\">Conquest of the Kingdom (Sprint)<!-- --> \u00b7 forms in<!-- --> <!-- -->7 minutes</p><p style=\"font-size:13.5px;margin:auto 0 0;padding-top:8px\"><a style=\"color:var(--color-primary);font-weight:600\" href=\"/signup\">Sign up and take a seat \u2192</a></p></div><div class=\"bp-card\" style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;padding:18px 20px;border-radius:var(--radius-md)\" data-testid=\"landing-leaders\"><h3 style=\"font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:var(--color-text-muted);margin:0\">Who rules</h3><ol style=\"list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px\"><li style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:8px;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:var(--color-text-muted);font-size:12px;width:16px\">1<!-- -->.</span><span style=\"font-weight:600;color:var(--color-text);overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap;flex:1\">neoliminal</span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;color:var(--color-text-muted);font-size:13px\">1536</span></li><li style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:8px;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:var(--color-text-muted);font-size:12px;width:16px\">2<!-- -->.</span><span style=\"font-weight:600;color:var(--color-text);overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap;flex:1\">Troy Dreadmoor</span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;color:var(--color-text-muted);font-size:13px\">1504</span></li><li style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:8px;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:var(--color-text-muted);font-size:12px;width:16px\">3<!-- -->.</span><span style=\"font-weight:600;color:var(--color-text);overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap;flex:1\">gekooktei</span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;color:var(--color-text-muted);font-size:13px\">1496</span></li></ol><p style=\"font-size:13.5px;margin:auto 0 0;padding-top:8px\"><a style=\"color:var(--color-primary);font-weight:600\" href=\"/leaderboard\">The full ledger \u2192</a></p></div></div></section><section style=\"position:relative;z-index:2;max-width:880px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:56px\" aria-label=\"Word from the realm\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px\"><h2 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading);font-size:13px;letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:var(--color-gold-warm);text-align:center;margin:0\">Word from the realm</h2><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));gap:16px\"><a class=\"bp-card\" style=\"display:block;padding:18px 20px;border-radius:var(--radius-md);text-decoration:none\" href=\"/blog/the-realm-has-a-web\"><time dateTime=\"2026-09-02\" style=\"display:block;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.10em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:var(--color-text-muted);margin-bottom:6px\">September 2, 2026</time><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading);font-size:17px;font-weight:700;color:var(--color-text);margin:0 0 6px\">The realm has a web</h3><p style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--color-text-muted);margin:0\">New realms are born already entangled: neighboring offices keep accords, courts answer to their heads, the crown reaches down to the provinces, and your own household starts with a friendly face at the nearest tavern. Most of these threads begin hidden.</p></a><a class=\"bp-card\" style=\"display:block;padding:18px 20px;border-radius:var(--radius-md);text-decoration:none\" href=\"/blog/ink-and-seal\"><time dateTime=\"2026-09-02\" style=\"display:block;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.10em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:var(--color-text-muted);margin-bottom:6px\">September 2, 2026</time><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading);font-size:17px;font-weight:700;color:var(--color-text);margin:0 0 6px\">Ink and seal</h3><p style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--color-text-muted);margin:0\">Everything you can click in the realm&#x27;s prose now speaks one language: dotted blue ink looks closer, and the pawn&#x27;s mark commits your people to a deed.</p></a></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:16px;text-align:center\"><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--color-on-canvas);max-width:480px;margin:0\">The gates stand open while the realm is in beta. No invitation needed; make an account and take a seat. The court gathers in Discord to trade grievances and plan the next game.</p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/nv5xP6zEkd\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"padding:13px 28px;background:linear-gradient(180deg, var(--color-primary-strong), var(--color-primary-strong-hover));color:#fff;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;border-radius:10px;font-family:var(--font-body);letter-spacing:0.02em;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(16,19,31,0.12), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.18)\">Join the court on Discord</a><p style=\"font-size:14px;color:var(--color-on-canvas-muted);margin:0\">Or look around first:<!-- --> <a style=\"color:var(--color-primary);font-weight:600\" href=\"/leaderboard\">see who rules the leaderboard</a> <!-- -->or<!-- --> <a style=\"color:var(--color-primary);font-weight:600\" href=\"/blog\">read the dispatches</a>.</p></div></section><footer style=\"position:relative;z-index:2;margin-top:72px;padding:28px 24px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:12px\" aria-label=\"Site\"><nav style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;gap:10px 26px\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;